  "worked_solution": "The truth set of $\u00acP(x)$ is the *complement* of the truth set of $P(x):$\n\n$$\n{T}_{\u00acP}={\\overset{\u2015}{T}}_{P}\n$$\n\nTherefore, to get the truth set of $\u00acP(x),$ we take all the points that belong to $U$ and do not lie in ${T}_{p},$ as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14099575/assets/9abb3d8964713cf893acb17f26742eed4c5c442ce813cd81ed4d5aba26968bda.png)",
